      "writtenOn": "2024-01-12T18:07:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, I have a patch ready to be uploaded for that.\n\nI am observing that modifying this power signal polarity and assertion logic is conflicting with the expectations introduced by this patch: CL:5154073, since it assumes that all evaluated power signals have same polarity.",
