      "writtenOn": "2024-01-12T18:44:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `verify_ap_inputs()` check uses the `gpio_emul_output_get()` which reads the physical pin state.  While in G3, all signals to the AP should be at a physical 0 and while in S0 all should be physical 1.\n\nBecause the check is on the physical level, it shouldn\u0027t matter if the signal is configured for active high/active low.  Is this assumption not correct?",
      "parentUuid": "1ca4f4a6_a56d0643",
      "revId": "d03729346c5f030ffa721c9ab0676f64a75acf55",
